  "guide.tempad.page.6.body": "The Time Twister records deaths, respawns and dimension travel. Use it to choose a recent marked event and return there for a chronon cost. Right-click a Time Twister onto a Tempad in your inventory to install it. The Tempad then has a Timeline button and a separate Twister charge reserve. Right-click the Tempad onto an empty slot to remove the Twister.",
