  "guide.tempad.page.5.title": "Markers and Chronomarks",
  "guide.tempad.page.5.body": "Place a marker to create a destination visible in your Tempad. Open it with an empty hand to edit its name, portal color and access. Chronomarks also support access for your FTB Team when FTB Teams is installed, and let you set the arrival height and angle. Use a Location Card on a marker to link it; a Projector using that card follows marker changes. Breaking the marker or revoking access closes its Timedoor.",
