  ,"guide.tempad.page.7.title": "Player destinations"
  ,"guide.tempad.page.7.body": "Install the Player Teleport Upgrade in a Tempad at a Workstation to see available players. A Location Broadcaster lets everyone find its carrier while enabled. A Screening Device can be off, public, or limited to the carrier's FTB Team when FTB Teams is installed. Right-click either device to change its mode; carry it or equip it in a Curios charm slot. Player destinations update when the Tempad is opened and again when a Timedoor is used. They cannot be exported to cards."
